        "audio": "Option A, two lakh seventy seven thousand two hundred and eighteen. Option B, ten thousand and ninety eight. Option C, twelve thousand three hundred and forty five. Option D, one lakh eighty one thousand nine hundred and ninety eight. Only one of these four is divisible by both nine and eleven.",
