            "text": "Rule of 9 — Key Rule",
            "audio": "Rule of Nine. Add all the digits of the number. If the digit sum is divisible by nine, the number is divisible by nine.",
            "render": {
              "action": "show",
              "target": "concept_text",
              "heading": "Rule of 9",
              "items": ["Add all digits.", "If the digit sum divides by 9, the number divides by 9."]
            }
          },

          {
            "text": "Rule of 11 — Key Rule",
            "audio": "Rule of Eleven. Assign alternating plus and minus signs to digits from left to right. If the result is zero or divisible by eleven, the number is divisible by eleven.",
